title: "Neural-network-assisted MIP for the Unit Commitment problem: models, code and results"
abstract: >-
  GAMS models, MATLAB pipeline, trained neural networks, calibrated fixing bands and
  campaign results of the four test cases of the Gran Canaria power system (thermal and
  hydrothermal, base and extended formulation) used in the accompanying paper.
